DATA AND REFERENCE MATERIAL
===========================

labels/       Address attribution packs assembled from first-party and
              licensed sources only. Each row records its own source and
              method; see labels/README.md. No crowd-sourced attribution is
              admitted as citable evidence.

assets/       Verified asset registry (contract addresses and decimals).

bridges/      Cross-chain bridge address reference data.

